      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Putting Sun Tzu's strategies into action, Max plucks two red hairs from Senya's head so he can pit the line cook against Ilya. Meanwhile, Chef Barinov calls Elena Pavlovna to smooth over the morning's awkwardness by inviting her to a formal dinner at Claude Monet.",
