      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you think you are doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мне нужно два волоса.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need two hairs from your head.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А лучше два, вдруг один потеряю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Better make it two, just in case I lose one.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Зачем тебе мой волос?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you need my hair?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Когда одиноко, смотреть на них и вспоминать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To look at them and remember you whenever I feel lonely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Очень смешно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Very funny.'",
